    <briefdescription>
<para>Fullscreen quad VAO/VBO — shared geometry for all shader passes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns a VAO and a VBO with 4 vertices in a triangle strip covering [-1,1] NDC. The VAO captures the VBO binding and vertex attrib pointer setup at <ref refid="structshader_1_1_quad_1a2f7c8b0a3beaa4c91698aee32f093de6" kindref="member">create()</ref> time, so <ref refid="structshader_1_1_quad_1a67729686a31a58bd02578f473136734f" kindref="member">draw()</ref> only needs to bind the VAO — compatible with core profile contexts.</para>
<para>GL resource lifecycle: <ref refid="structshader_1_1_quad_1a2f7c8b0a3beaa4c91698aee32f093de6" kindref="member">create()</ref> allocates VAO + VBO on the GL thread (call from newOpenGLContextCreated). <ref refid="structshader_1_1_quad_1a23b41191d7a967586a196278862db086" kindref="member">destroy()</ref> releases them (call from openGLContextClosing).</para>
<para>Thread contract: ALL methods GL THREAD only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
